### Thunder Client / VS Code REST Client — copy into Postman/Insomnia if you prefer
@base = http://localhost:5000/api/items

### CREATE
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Paracetamol 500mg", "sku": "MED-001", "category": "Medicine", "quantity": 100, "price": 2.5 }

### READ ALL
GET {{base}}

### READ ONE (replace ID)
GET {{base}}/PASTE_ID_HERE

### UPDATE (replace ID)
PUT {{base}}/PASTE_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 80, "price": 3 }

### DELETE (replace ID)
DELETE {{base}}/PASTE_ID_HERE
